{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/pulls/1281","id":4994953866,"node_id":"PR_kwDOUoK9js8AAAABKbjyig","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/pull/1281","diff_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/pull/1281.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas/chicago/pull/1281.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/issues/1281","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/pulls/1281/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/pulls/1281/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/issues/1281/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/statuses/cb0d116697af18b92added295edffcfbac329672","number":1281,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"T-3113: 1812 Prairie's balcony and projection top to the Levy photograph","user":{"login":"kevinrhaas","id":4193586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTM1ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4193586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## T-3113 — 1812 Prairie's balcony and projection top to the Levy photograph\n\nPiece 1 of T-3092, which this run split (`T-3114` keeps the entrance arch, transom, fanlight and stair: the elliptical head needs K06's shared `Head`, and the jamb on the projection's corner needs K08 or K07 geometry of its own).\n\n**What.** The south projection's balcony is now built the way Albert Levy's print shows its front run:\n- a stone panel 3.14 m across (x 390-680 px), 0.09 m high at its ends, sweeping straight up over 0.8 m to 0.42 m shoulders, then level to a pedestal 0.32 m across and 0.52 m high, under a cap that sits at about the rail's top (x 527-557 px);\n- an iron scroll hung from the rail over each sweep, and a carved scroll on the panel beside the pedestal;\n- the top rail runs into the pedestal, and the foot rail stops at the panel's ends;\n- a roundel under the rail on every baluster.\n\nThe projection's top comes down to the print's cornice. Its last storey is now 3.65 m, so the wall head stands at 9.25 m under a 0.2 m × 0.15 m eave whose top is at 9.40 m. Before, K08's 0.35/0.28 m eave over 9.45 m put the top at 9.73 m, about 25-30 px over the print's cornice. K08's balcony learns `panel` and `roundel`, both validated in `k01_frontage_params`. All 24 other K01 houses re-emit byte-identical; only their manifest input hashes move.\n\n**Records.** Levy items 15 and 16 and c. 1955 item 11 are now `fixed`. Two new open Levy items: the stone frieze under the cornice (built in brick), and the cornice's moulded section. The liberty is `L-k08-1812-balcony-panel-3113`. It records what is invented: the panel's thickness, the scroll form, and the 0.07 m scroll radius against the print's about 0.11 m.\n\n**Verification.**\n- `tools/check.sh`: **CHECK PASS**, 1063 steps, none red. Along the way it caught two coplanar overlaps in K08 (the pedestal's bed, the scroll's core), and both are fixed. numpy appears only in tagged self-test lines.\n- Smoke legs (`--for-diff` names parts 1-15, because the mesh moved):\n  - desktop 3: 107/107 pass;\n  - mobile 3: 107/107 pass;\n  - desktop 14: killed by the 590 s foreground cap (dev's own reading of that part is 29 min), not a verdict;\n  - desktop 1: killed by the cap at load 4.4 after 65 passes and no failure, not a verdict.\n- Photo match: both views re-rendered on the final GLB. The balcony and the cornice read within a few px of the print through the Levy camera.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","labels":[{"id":12374546158,"node_id":"LA_kwDOUoK9js8AAAAC4ZSW7g","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kevinrhaas/chicago/labels/resume","name":"resume","description":"A run could not finish this; the next one picks it up — reason in the resume: comment","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-24T11:22:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:51:45Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"kevinrhaas:steward/t3113-1812-balcony-panel","ref":"steward/t3113-1812-balcony-panel","repo":{"id":1384299918,"node_id":"R_kgDOUoK9jg","name":"chicago","full_name":"kevinrhaas/chicago","owner":{"login":"kevinrhaas","id":4193586,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTM1ODY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4193586?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas","html_url":"https://github.com/kevinrhaas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kevinrhaas/repos","